<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Though He was rejected</l><l>By men who were blinded;</l><l>His love is constraining,</l><l>His heart still unchanging;</l><l>Thus in incarnation</l><l>Came He as salvation;</l><l>His name is called Jesus,</l><l>And He came to seek us.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Though born as a sinner,</l><l>His blood has redeemed me.</l><l>He suffered on Calv’ry,</l><l>Then raised up in glory,</l><l>To regenerate me.</l><l>Now joined in one spirit</l><l>I love to enjoy Him,</l><l>For I’ve been forgiven!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>His love is so tender,</l><l>To Him I’ll surrender;</l><l>His name is so precious,</l><l>I gladly call, “Jesus!”</l><l>His Person’s so charming,</l><l>My heart ever winning;</l><l>I’ll hold back no longer,</l><l>I’ll love Him forever.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
